grimoire-linux (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First packaged release, as Grimoire Linux (github.com/cookedaj/grimoire-linux).
  * New name shown everywhere; commands, settings folders and app ids are unchanged.
  * Licensed GPL-3.0-or-later.
  * System-wide .deb and AUR packages; a packaged copy leaves updates to the
    package manager.
  * Spells: MuraL, SightsL, VaultL, OptimizeL, SystemL, TerminalL, ShotL,
    FocusL and NetL, plus the tray icon, Settings (hotkeys, backup & restore,
    GitHub sign-in) and self-update for per-user installs.

